<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/1/msa@/~cl_6__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memotong subseksyen (3);"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/1/msa@> .
